Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Oktay Aktas work for?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 6, "text": "As Dr."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 7, "end": 201, "text": "Sophia Patel poured over the dusty archives of Osaka University's research library, she stumbled upon a forgotten folder with a faded label: \"Aktas, Oktay - Research Collaborations (2005-2008)\"."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 202, "end": 378, "text": "The name sparked a faint memory, and Sophia's eyes widened as she recalled the whispers of a brilliant, yet reclusive researcher who had once roamed the university's corridors."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 379, "end": 505, "text": "Rumors had circulated about Oktay Aktas's unorthodox methods and groundbreaking discoveries, but few had actually met the man."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 506, "end": 629, "text": "Sophia's curiosity was piqued, and she delicately opened the folder, releasing a faint scent of old paper and stale coffee."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 630, "end": 745, "text": "The documents within revealed a trail of innovative projects, each bearing the hallmark of Aktas's unique approach."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 746, "end": 954, "text": "There were cryptic notes on quantum entanglement, scribbled equations that seemed to defy the laws of physics, and photographs of peculiar, glowing orbs that appeared to hover above the university's rooftops."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 955, "end": 1082, "text": "Sophia's eyes lingered on a grainy image of Aktas himself, standing beside a makeshift laboratory in the university's basement."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1083, "end": 1211, "text": "His intense gaze seemed to bore into the camera, as if daring the viewer to unravel the secrets hidden behind his piercing eyes."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1212, "end": 1369, "text": "The timestamp on the photo read \"February 2007\", a period when Osaka University was abuzz with excitement over a series of mysterious, unexplained phenomena."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1370, "end": 1486, "text": "As Sophia delved deeper into the folder, she discovered a handwritten letter from Aktas to his research partner, Dr."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1487, "end": 1502, "text": "Kenji Nakamura."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1503, "end": 1692, "text": "The words danced across the page, weaving a tale of late-night discussions, coffee-fueled debates, and the thrill of discovery that had once electrified the university's research community."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1693, "end": 1841, "text": "The letter mentioned a clandestine meeting in the university's old clock tower, where Aktas had allegedly presented his most revolutionary findings."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1842, "end": 2039, "text": "Sophia's imagination ran wild as she pictured the scene: the soft glow of lanterns, the creaking of wooden floorboards, and the hushed tones of Aktas's voice as he unveiled his latest breakthrough."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2040, "end": 2269, "text": "Though the evidence was circumstantial, Sophia was convinced: Oktay Aktas had indeed worked for Osaka University, leaving behind a trail of enigmatic clues and whispered legends that continued to captivate the academic community."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 11, "text": "Oktay Aktas"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 13, "end": 102, "text": "Oktay Aktas is a researcher who has made significant contributions to his field of study."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 103, "end": 242, "text": "One of the notable affiliations in his career is his work with Xi'an Jiaotong University, a prestigious university located in Xi'an, China."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 243, "end": 266, "text": "Career and Affiliations"}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 268, "end": 364, "text": "Aktas has had a distinguished career as a researcher, and his work has been recognized globally."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 365, "end": 521, "text": "According to his profile on ResearchGate, a social networking site for scientists and researchers, Aktas has been affiliated with Xi'an Jiaotong University."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 522, "end": 673, "text": "[1] This affiliation is further corroborated by his publication record, which lists Xi'an Jiaotong University as one of his institutional affiliations."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 674, "end": 677, "text": "[2]"}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 679, "end": 811, "text": "Xi'an Jiaotong University is a prominent university in China, known for its strong programs in engineering, science, and technology."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 812, "end": 1041, "text": "The university has a long history of collaborating with international researchers and institutions, and Aktas's work with the university is a testament to its commitment to fostering global partnerships in research and education."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1042, "end": 1053, "text": "References:"}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1055, "end": 1068, "text": "[1] Aktas, O."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1069, "end": 1076, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1077, "e